          },
          {
            "id": "auZO7UEQ0SClT8DpRU1IW",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": -80.50290624509853,
              "y": -527.8860145199684
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "Adidas",
              "fontColor": "#1e1e1e",
              "fontSize": 36,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 128,
              "height": 65
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "8vje3mG75SGT0bOgEVi77",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": -648.2530408494163,
              "y": 133.22111177048924
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "Who is Nike's target audience?",
              "fontColor": "#1e1e1e",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 294,
              "height": 44
            },
            "zIndex": 3
          },
          {
            "id": "w3m3AwBiQ6Rl3sBSsxBVb",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": -176.45245796367465,
              "y": 135.79252290330174
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "Who is Adidas's target audience?",
              "fontColor": "#1e1e1e",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 314,
              "height": 44
            },
            "zIndex": 4
          },
          {
            "id": "3oIuTdex4qNvS536GnmBs",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": -703.8944920038527,
              "y": -43.364585076609046
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "What do you notice about the Nike brand?",
              "fontColor": "#1e1e1e",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 398,
              "height": 44
            },
            "zIndex": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "62BhzLNmf-O6fEobbr2wN",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": -240.25298853356844,
              "y": -43.350281923707314
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "What do you notice about the Adidas brand?",
              "fontColor": "#1e1e1e",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 418,
              "height": 44
            },
            "zIndex": 2
          },
          {
            "id": "aQoavinT8-kmUmjwVQQNR",
            "type": "shape",
            "position": {
              "x": -745.6020275401427,
              "y": -49.636630963215765
            },
            "style": {
              "width": 970.7782622578663,
              "height": 401.7916062104527
            },
            "data": {
              "shapeType": "rectangle",
              "label": "",
              "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
              "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e"
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 971,
              "height": 402
            },
            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "AadnWbe7M6rHHVGykvKZY",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": -716.4659031366651,
              "y": 6.639335927839781
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "The Nike brand ...\n- Uses powerful, confident fonts and close-up images of athletes.\n- Bold black and white theme with strong contrast.\n- Clean layout with rounded buttons and simple icons.",
              "fontColor": "#e03131",
              "fontSize": 14.399998256138392,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 439,
              "height": 93
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "-5kjzrcIgvps80ww-5LLj",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": -243.18823476116896,
              "y": 18.71358329111741
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "The Adidas brand ...\n- Bright, energetic colors (yellow and red).\n- Urban, sporty look with focus on pop culture events like FIFA.\n- Bold text and sharp graphic design. ",
              "fontColor": "#e03131",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 466,
              "height": 101
            },
            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "l9aWkiCku0LGYK4vmH27l",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": -706.9257071266206,
              "y": 202.64964832182847
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "It seems like Nike's target audience is \nTeens and young adults who are into sports and \ncompetition. The dark colors and intense athlete\n images make it feel serious and powerful.",
              "fontColor": "#e03131",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 363,
              "height": 101
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "jQG1PEfO0DYdKJ7PMpI2_",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": -224.73815481077224,
              "y": 205.93534516892674
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "It seems like Adidas's target audience is \nTeens and young adults who like sports and big events \nlike soccer. The bright colors and bold graphics feel \nenergetic and trendy.",
              "fontColor": "#e03131",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 410,
              "height": 101
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "qQ8kjJ_AZHbQqKGJGa4kt",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": 425.74723235556826,
              "y": 131.79262026890876
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "Who is Spotify's target audience?",
              "fontColor": "#1e1e1e",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 319,
              "height": 44
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "ykZPol0WcxySurZ4SWcAp",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": 899.8335818428723,
              "y": 134.36403140172126
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "Who is SoundCloud's target audience?",
              "fontColor": "#1e1e1e",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 365,
              "height": 44
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "PVCNlpnxpZgHGmQxBOWhL",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": 372.3915478026943,
              "y": -44.7930765781897
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "What do you notice about the Spotify brand?",
              "fontColor": "#1e1e1e",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 423,
              "height": 44
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l8l-BQxTn4D0apGFccmxH",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": 836.0330512729784,
              "y": -44.778773425287795
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "What do you notice about the SoundCloud brand?",
              "fontColor": "#1e1e1e",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 469,
              "height": 44
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "GY1VeoIzabITXrZwS3u4m",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": 378.10583351698006,
              "y": 16.47637405239858
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "The Spotify brand ...\n- Dark mode look with neon-like album covers that pop.\n- Modern, clean, and easy to navigate.\n- Feels chill and music-focused. ",
              "fontColor": "#e03131",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 413,
              "height": 101
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "lY7vgsdujsthf7z3SWIZm",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": 858.2174057826048,
              "y": 14.897589277305325
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "The SoundCloud brand ... \n- Uses gray and black tones with big, bold text.\n- Focuses on creators — “upload” and “create account” stand out.\n- Feels more indie and raw than Spotify.",
              "fontColor": "#e03131",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 486,
              "height": 101
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "M_urrXCbvN5XA-Ie4RlJV",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": 369.3603326799264,
              "y": 196.22115682024798
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "It seems like Spotify's target audience is \nTeens and young adults who listen to music a lot. \nThe dark theme makes the album covers stand out \nand feel modern.",
              "fontColor": "#e03131",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 381,
              "height": 101
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "gFzkrqZo7IzFgD1xBoIBz",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": 850.4049580984533,
              "y": 202.00685366734626
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "It seems like SoundCloud's target audience is \nIndependent artists and people who like discovering new music. \nThe focus on uploading and creators makes it feel more \nfor musicians.",
              "fontColor": "#e03131",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 478,
              "height": 101
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "Bszt2kPlXfCBRUyQ0DANT",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": 580.1578807015153,
              "y": -540.6931158150758
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "Spotify",
              "fontColor": "#1e1e1e",
              "fontSize": 36,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 136,
              "height": 65
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "zXrS5AICIc8e91kCS2-NX",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": 930.8928976605696,
              "y": -536.6932204467721
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "SoundCloud",
              "fontColor": "#1e1e1e",
              "fontSize": 36,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 218,
              "height": 65
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "D_S4J4UCF0qinm4jGtDIF",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": -494.20821597671795,
              "y": 416.0687003005311
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "Netflix",
              "fontColor": "#1e1e1e",
              "fontSize": 36,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 126,
              "height": 65
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "F0fvMCJ54T41yr-pdXBzP",
            "type": "text",
            "position": {
              "x": -130.38237925012083,
              "y": 414.92590419282953
            },
            "data": {
              "text": "Disney",
              "fontColor": "#1e1e1e",
              "fontSize": 36,
              "showHandles": false
            },
            "measured": {
              "width": 126,
              "height": 65
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "owj9MdYH85tJmFTR0pVo6",
            "type": "shape",
            "position": {
              "x": -743.4797579641051,
              "y": 888.2897773157766
            },
            "style": {
              "width": 1002.7782099420182,
              "height": 401.7916062104527
            },
            "data": {
              "shapeType": "rectangle",
              "label": "",
